---
import SectionTitle from '../../ui/SectionTitle.astro';
---
<section class="section_journey">
  <div class="journey-bg-color">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
      <div class="journey-wrapper">
        <div class="journey-top-wrapper">
          <div page-scroll-0="" class="journey-title-block">
            <SectionTitle text="OUR JOURNEY" />
          </div>
          <div class="section-header-block">
            <h2 title-scroll="" class="heading-style-2">From Vision to Measurable Business Impact</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-content-wrapper">
          <div class="journey-line-block">
            <div class="journey-line">
              <div class="journey-line-point"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="journey-content-block">
            <div class="journey-single-card is-01">
              <div class="journey-year-text is-01">2020</div>
              <div class="journey-image-block"><img src="/images/Journey-Image-1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="journey-image" class="journey-image"></div>
              <div class="journey-card-details-block is-01">
                <div class="journey-card-title-block is-max-width">
                  <h3 class="journey-card-title">The Beginning of Clavix</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="journey-text">Clavix was founded with a vision to help businesses overcome challenges through strategic consulting and practical growth solutions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-single-card is-02">
              <div class="journey-year-text is-02">2022</div>
              <div class="journey-image-block"><img src="/images/Journey-Image-2.webp" loading="lazy" alt="journey-image" class="journey-image"></div>
              <div class="journey-card-details-block is-02">
                <div class="journey-card-title-block">
                  <h3 class="journey-card-title">Expanding Our Consulting Services</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="journey-text">We broadened our expertise across business strategy, operations, and performance optimization to serve a wider range of clients.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-single-card is-03">
              <div class="journey-year-text is-03">2024</div>
              <div class="journey-image-block"><img src="/images/Journey-Image-3.webp" loading="lazy" alt="journey-image" class="journey-image"></div>
              <div class="journey-card-details-block is-03">
                <div class="journey-card-title-block">
                  <h3 class="journey-card-title">Strengthening Industry Expertise</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="journey-text">We expanded our capabilities and refined our consulting frameworks to provide even greater value and insights to our clients.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-single-card is-04">
              <div class="journey-year-text is-04">2026</div>
              <div class="journey-image-block"><img src="/images/Journey-Image-4.webp" loading="lazy" alt="journey-image" class="journey-image"></div>
              <div class="journey-card-details-block is-04">
                <div class="journey-card-title-block">
                  <h3 class="journey-card-title">A Trusted Partner for Success</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="journey-text">Today, Clavix continues to empower ambitious businesses with innovative strategies, expert guidance, &amp; a commitment to sustainable growth.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
